From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:34:14 +0000
Subject: inspector: defer DOMStorage reads out of V8 interrupts

DOMStorage.getDOMStorageItems reads globalThis.localStorage or
globalThis.sessionStorage when no notification has registered the
store yet. Both are JavaScript getters, and a message from a remote
frontend is dispatched from a V8 API interrupt when it arrives while
JavaScript is running. V8 builds with
v8_disallow_js_in_api_interrupts_is_checked abort there with
"Invoke in DisallowJavascriptExecutionScope", which made
test-inspector-dom-storage-malformed crash intermittently.

Make getDOMStorageItems an async command and, when it is dispatched
from an interrupt, answer it from an immediate instead, where calling
into JavaScript is allowed. The new test keeps the inspected process
running JavaScript so that the command is dispatched from an
interrupt.

This should be upstreamed together with
https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/65397, which enables the check in
Node.js's own V8 build.

diff --git a/src/inspector/dom_storage_agent.cc b/src/inspector/dom_storage_agent.cc
index 7d3ce9dc5d06a478b8d0b14323684c6410412e9f..dc5cab67f9a00b1c34f3ae617d38c12bf97012ba 100644
--- a/src/inspector/dom_storage_agent.cc
+++ b/src/inspector/dom_storage_agent.cc
@@ -87,7 +87,37 @@ protocol::DispatchResponse DOMStorageAgent::disable() {
   return protocol::DispatchResponse::Success();
 }
 
-protocol::DispatchResponse DOMStorageAgent::getDOMStorageItems(
+void DOMStorageAgent::getDOMStorageItems(
+    std::unique_ptr<protocol::DOMStorage::StorageId> storageId,
+    std::unique_ptr<GetDOMStorageItemsCallback> callback) {
+  // A message from a remote frontend can be dispatched from a V8 interrupt,
+  // and V8 forbids calling into JavaScript there. Reading a store may run the
+  // localStorage or sessionStorage getter, so answer from an immediate, where
+  // JavaScript can run, instead.
+  if (env_->is_processing_v8_interrupt()) {
+    env_->SetImmediate(
+        [this,
+         alive = std::weak_ptr<bool>(alive_),
+         storage_id = std::move(storageId),
+         callback = std::move(callback)](Environment* env) mutable {
+          // The session, and this agent with it, may be gone by now.
+          if (alive.expired()) return;
+          getDOMStorageItems(std::move(storage_id), std::move(callback));
+        });
+    return;
+  }
+
+  std::unique_ptr<protocol::Array<protocol::Array<protocol::String>>> items;
+  protocol::DispatchResponse response =
+      readDOMStorageItems(std::move(storageId), &items);
+  if (response.IsSuccess()) {
+    callback->sendSuccess(std::move(items));
+  } else {
+    callback->sendFailure(response);
+  }
+}
+
+protocol::DispatchResponse DOMStorageAgent::readDOMStorageItems(
     std::unique_ptr<protocol::DOMStorage::StorageId> storageId,
     std::unique_ptr<protocol::Array<protocol::Array<protocol::String>>>*
         items) {
